"in. If **rd** is set this should be NULL. Note that if you set this to NULL "
"you should still set rd->alpha2 to some accepted alpha2."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../driver-api/80211/cfg80211:149: ../include/net/cfg80211.h:8071
msgid ""
"Wireless drivers can use this function to hint to the wireless core what it "
"believes should be the current regulatory domain by giving it an ISO/IEC "
"3166 alpha2 country code it knows its regulatory domain should be in or by "
"providing a completely build regulatory domain. If the driver provides an "
"ISO/IEC 3166 alpha2 userspace will be queried for a regulatory domain "
"structure for the respective country."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../driver-api/80211/cfg80211:149: ../include/net/cfg80211.h:8078
