"any data that is put into the skb (with skb_put(), nla_put() or similar) "
"will end up being within the ``NL80211_ATTR_TESTDATA`` attribute, so all "
"that needs to be done with the skb is adding data for the corresponding "
"userspace tool which can then read that data out of the testdata attribute. "
"You must not modify the skb in any other way."
